Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:07:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1989/3799] soh: rename func_80A98ECC ->
 EnKo_UpdateByForestQuestState

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: dispatches to the per-quest-state update, short-circuiting to EnKo_UpdateTrackNearbyPlayer for Fado in the Lost Woods
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ko/z_en_ko.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ko/z_en_ko.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ko/z_en_ko.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ko/z_en_ko.c
index e3c88bf10..b15f92333 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ko/z_en_ko.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ko/z_en_ko.c
@@ -29,7 +29,8 @@ void func_80A99438(EnKo* this, PlayState* play);
 void func_80A99504(EnKo* this, PlayState* play);
 void func_80A99560(EnKo* this, PlayState* play);
 
-s32 func_80A98ECC(EnKo* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A98ECC: dispatches to the per-quest-state update, short-circuiting to EnKo_UpdateTrackNearbyPlayer for Fado in the Lost Woods
+s32 EnKo_UpdateByForestQuestState(EnKo* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80A98ECC [LLM:HIGH]
 
 const ActorInit En_Ko_InitVars = {
     ACTOR_EN_KO,
@@ -979,7 +980,7 @@ void EnKo_TrackPlayerAndTalk(EnKo* this, PlayState* play) {
     } else {
         this->interactInfo.trackPos = player->actor.world.pos;
